From: onedots <onedots0@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 3 May 2026 19:56:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: import Broadcom bcmdhd vendor driver

Import the Broadcom bcmdhd FullMAC driver sources (GPLv2, unmodified
vendor code) under drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd. Split out from the
BCM43436 bring-up so the board integration can be reviewed separately.
