+ *
+ *    Code Unused memory   Random numbers   Random number    Magic number    NVRAM      NVRAM
+ *                                          byte Count       0xFEEDC0DE                 Size
+ *   |<-----Variable---->|<---Variable--->|<-----4 bytes-->|<---4 bytes---->|<---V--->|<--4B--->|
+ *                       |<------------- BCM_ENTROPY_HOST_MAXSIZE --------->|
+ */
